    "detailed_description": "Dangerous Chris is a 2D Top Down game with elements of action, exploration, shooter and adventure.<br />\r\nIn the game, you are Chris, a bitter man who had his family destroyed by a Chinese mobster leader. Chris, then, finding no other solution, seeks revenge, punishing those who caused him pain.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game contains several maps with varied gameplay. Some maps involving vehicle combat, distance combat, among other elements.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt has a soundtrack by map, being inspired by the games of the 90s, such as Grand Theft Auto 2, among others.",
